; Warning: SVX file generated by Tunnel.  Do not edit.  To change, edit your original files and save on top.
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
*begin allgrind
*data normal from to tape compass clino ignoreall
*units length metres
*calibrate tape 0.0
*units compass degrees
*calibrate compass 0.0
*units clino degrees
*calibrate clino 0.0
;end generated presettings


;for the Grind added 8.5 degrees to compass readings to get true north (so 1 to 2 measured 006)

*equate 	grind.8	darkside.44

*equate 	darkside.1	grindinghalt2.1

*equate 	grindinghalt2.3	grindinghalt1.21


*include grind/grind.svx
*include darkside/darkside.svx
*include grindinghalt2/grindinghalt2.svx
*include grindinghalt1/grindinghalt1.svx

*end allgrind
